<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hylsamex estimates cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hylsamex estimates cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Grupo Financiero Serfin cut its 1996 earnings per share estimate for steel firm Hylsamex to 9.18 pesos from 9.63, and cut its 1997 forecast to 6.42 pesos from 8.37.</p>
<p>-- Serfin maintained its buy recommendation on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Ivonne Delgadillo said the revisions were partly due to changes in the banking group's macroeconomic projections.</p>
<p>-- Daniel Perez-Whitaker, Monterrey Bureau 528 345-7617</p>
